{"id": 994633, "slug": "hidden-cats-in-tokyo", "name": "Hidden Cats in Tokyo", "name_original": "Hidden Cats in Tokyo", "description": "<p><strong>A great danger is turning Tokyo's cats into monsters! Let's vaccinate and cure them before the situation gets worse!</strong></p><p>Hidden Cats in Tokyo is a <strong>hidden object adventure game</strong>, where you need to find all the cats in Tokyo and vaccinate them before they turn into dangerous monsters and destroy the city.</p><p>There are over <strong>1400 cats </strong>to find, and almost 1750 total hidden objects. </p>Explore the <strong>15 levels</strong> of the city, gather the hero cats, and solve the mystery!<h3>Discover Tokyo's Landmarks</h3><h3>Gather  Hero Cats from Tokyo</h3><ul><li><p>Collect many achievements from hero cat cards, monster cats, real cats, and cat things. </p></li><li><p>Assemble your robot and face the giant monster.</p></li><li><p>Use the radar to help search for cats.</p></li><li><p>Mini-Games</p></li><li><p>Story</p></li><li><p>Dynamic Sound FX</p></li><li><p>Exclusive Soundtrack</p></li></ul><p><strong>More than 1400 cats.</strong></p><p><strong>Almost 1750 objects in total.</strong></p><h3>Accessibility</h3><ul><li><p>Dark Mode</p></li><li><p>Invert Mouse Zoom</p></li><li><p>Mouse Drag Sensitivity</p></li><li><p>Edge Screen Scrolling</p></li><li><p>Color Blindness</p></li></ul>", "metacritic": null, "metacritic_platforms": [], "released": "2024-12-12", "tba": false, "updated": "2026-01-12T19:45:44", "background_image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/e21/e2171bfe02f538a17d09c8f544583cf1.jpg", "background_image_additional": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/648/6481f2fbee073edaba1c925dd9aaf703.jpg", "website": "", "rating": 0.0, "rating_top": 0, "ratings": [{"id": 4, "title": "recommended", "count": 2, "percent": 100.0}], "reactions": {"7": 1}, "added": 3, "added_by_status": {"beaten": 3}, "playtime": 0, "screenshots_count": 14, "movies_count": 0, "creators_count": 0,